cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or these scripts, please cite them as below."
title: "ngpl-india-network: a provenance-separated reconstruction of India's authorised natural gas transmission network"
abstract: >-
  A machine-readable reconstruction of India's authorised natural gas
  transmission network, built from the PNGRB Natural Gas Pipeline Networks
  register of December 2025. Covers 99 authorised pipelines, of which 37
  Common Carrier pipelines form the analytical scope and 27 admit a node-edge
  representation. Every variable is labelled source-derived, GIS-derived or
  analytically derived. Includes 215 automated validation checks and five
  closure proofs against subtotals printed in the source. Version 2 adds a
  per-node measurement of how far a criticality ranking moves when one route
  point has no coordinate, and a validator that checks the data dictionary
  against the published headers in both directions.
type: dataset
version: 2.0.1
date-released: "2026-09-25"
license: CC-BY-4.0
license-url: "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rajshree-singh/ngpl-india-network"
# This version's DOI. The concept DOI, which always resolves to the newest
# version, is 10.5281/zenodo.22810050 and is deliberately NOT used here: a
# CITATION.cff describes the version it ships inside.
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22961485"
