# dataset reference in any paper citing this record. All three are listed in all
# three places. Change them together, never one alone.
# The accompanying Data in Brief article has a fourth author, Lakshay Saini, who
# contributed language editing to the manuscript and not to this dataset. He is
# a contributor on the Zenodo record, not a creator, and so is deliberately
# absent here. A paper and the dataset it describes may have different author
# lists; the article's CRediT statement is what records each contribution.
# Add "orcid:" to each author once the iDs are to hand; the field is optional and
